<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 19,922 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 19,922 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main Chittagong port handled 19,922 tonnes of cargo in 24 hours ending 1 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Monday, compared with 15,230 tonnes in the same period on Sunday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					Monday		  Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   2,159		   3,484</p>
<p>    Import cargo		  17,763		  11,746</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes     Ship		 Berthing</p>
<p>    Wheat		 18,334     Nira Maree	 5/11</p>
<p>    Cement		20,000     Xian Li	    6/11</p>
<p>    Cement		30,000     Tian Sheng No.8  7/11</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
